  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/684/717/cbf4e971-7207-4602-bd76-b44081f9b7df.png\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/15/custom-background-hd.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"78\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Resource Pack-HD-green?style=plastic\" /> <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/gamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/buy me a coffee-support-orange?style=plastic\" /></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/870825743788158986?color=blue&amp;style=plastic\" /></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/GamerPotionDev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/my other-projects-orange?style=plastic\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/get%20a%20server-click%20here-blue?style=plastic\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">摘要</span></p>\n<p>這是一個為我的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\">DarkRPG</a> 模組包所製作的自訂主選單背景資源包。現已獨立發布。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">說明</span></p>\n<p>此資源包讓你能將主選單背景更換為你選擇的任何圖片，進一步提升你的原版遊戲體驗。</p>\n<p>只需下載此資源包並套用，即可擁有自訂的主選單背景。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如何更換背景：</p>\n<p>- 從任何地方取得 PNG 截圖或 HD 圖片，然後覆蓋壓縮檔內的以下檔案：<em>Custom Background HD.zip / assets / minecraft / textures / gui / title / background /&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">panorama_overlay.png</span></em></p>\n<p>- 確保你的背景圖片已重新命名為「panorama_overlay.png」。</p>\n<p>- 套用資源包，即可享受自訂的主選單背景。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>圖片背景來源：https://pixabay.com/illustrations/fire-and-water-hands-fight-fire-2354583/</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/12/2023-11-16_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/13/2023-11-16_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/14/2023-11-16_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/434/158/dec51e74-03ba-4abb-920c-bdc47a4e302a.png\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ko-fi.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/brandasset/kofi_bg_tag_dark.png\" width=\"341\" height=\"129\" /></a></p>",
